James sought to recall an animated movie he had seen in theaters, remembering a scene with a "bad boy" in a classroom, sucking a lollipop as if it were a cigarette. I offered several animated titles, such as **Recess: School’s Out** and **South Park: Bigger, Longer & Uncut**, and asked for more details about the type of movie. James then recalled that the kids got superpowers, leading me to suggest **Sky High** (2005), a live-action film focusing on Will Stronghold, a superhero student, and Warren Peace, the brooding "bad boy."
